    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "`AlduinBase` (on *Alduin*), every other rung and `BleakFallsDragon` use `EncDragon01Fire` 01CA03 as a template for their look but set their own level, so changing it does not move them; the Serpentine rows use `EncDragon05Frost` the same way. Paarthurnax and the MQ206 and MQ306 dragons do follow its level (last bullet).",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "`dunLabyrinthianUndeadDragon` 09192C (the Skeletal Dragon, 20) is a dragon with no template; it is on *Unique Dragons*.",
      "Every other dragon record (the `NoScript` and `_MQ06` copies, the Frost and Snow variants, `lvlDragon`, `DLC2lvlDragon` and the other wrappers, the MQ206 and MQ306 dragons, the Skuldafn copies, Paarthurnax, Vulthuryol, Sahrotaar) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
